{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5872f9aa9dc5a833d4649","chatId":"97622726b1f24e69a7f4c6fc233591fa","sessionId":null,"userId":93933,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[C]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[C]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":13456,"promptTokens":2188,"completionTokens":109,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:30:23"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004609571769146091,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5872f9aa9dc5a833d4648","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794475823170,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:30:23","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5872f9aa9dc5a833d4648","chatId":"97622726b1f24e69a7f4c6fc233591fa","sessionId":null,"userId":93933,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n张权是社区的一位居民，受到周围人的肯定，他却不愿积极参与社区活动。静雅是社区活动的组织者，准备组织一次社区环保活动。好朋友王安看着张权，静雅靠过来对张权说了什么，然后握紧拳头，张权看着她，默不作声。静雅努力维持笑容，王安偷偷瞥了他们一眼。静雅走后，张权看着她的背影，眉头紧蹙。\n\n[问题]\n你认为张权现在是什么心情？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 张权对静雅感到生气和厌烦，希望静雅别来干扰他。\nB. 张权对自己的决定感到坚定和决绝，静雅的行为没有影响到他。\nC. 张权感到有点犹豫和矛盾，他不想参加活动但是也不想让静雅不高兴。\nD. 张权对即将做出的决定感到惊喜和期待。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004609571769146091,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5872f9aa9dc5a833d4649","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794475823167,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:30:23","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"c6c727ca5f234e4e833af7da0c34a335"}